# Issue #787: the reporter-position alias path reaching the user procedure's NO-OUTPUT guard.
# `forward` is a command here — it never reaches `return` — so using it as a reporter is
# `ol-no-output`. Fixtured because this diagnostic carries `params.procedure`, a DIFFERENT param
# name from the arity diagnostics' `params.callable`, and params on this path are exactly what
# this saga has gotten wrong five times.
define forward
  print 1
end
print fd